Designer overview

The Designer is the control room for this UI library.

It lets you:

- place controls and layouts
- inspect real runtime properties
- tweak role-based styling
- see the generated code before it escapes into the wild

That last part is the useful one.

This topic exists as a small Topic++ smoke test for the Designer package.
If this page opens in TheIDE, the docs wiring is alive and doing its job.
